  "name": "Big spinach, lentil and peanut bowl",
  "description": "A very large soy-free vegan lunch or dinner bowl for a high calorie target: twelve cups of spinach wilted into hard-seared mushrooms with warm cooked lentils, finished with dry roasted peanuts and cilantro.",
